# era-bank — UI rules

Applies to `era-bank/app/**` and `era-bank/src/components/**`.

Canon: [docs/UI_PLAYBOOK_SATELLITES.md](../../docs/UI_PLAYBOOK_SATELLITES.md) · hotel pilot patterns.

## Shell (variant 1 — sections + hubs)

- `BankOpsShell` uses `navSections` (not flat `navItems`): Core · Payments · Products · AML · Reports · Treasury · Risk · Admin.
- Header LTR: Locale → `SatelliteNotificationBell` → Org → Profile → `BankHeaderTierBar`.
- Menu from one kit `useOpsNavProfile` read of `GET /api/auth/me` (`permissions` + `activeModules`). Each row carries kit conditions: `permission` from `screenPermissionForNavHref`, `module` from the shell `NAV_MODULE_MAP`; `industry_banking` opens every module. `visibleOpsNavSections` paints once after the read.

## List screens (required)

- Every table page: `PageHeader` → `EraListFilterBar` → `BankDataGrid` (wraps kit `EraDataGrid`).
- Pagination: client footer on by default; i18n via `useListPaginationLabels`.
- Errors: `showApiError` toast — not inline `OpsError` for API failures.
- Amounts: major AZN in UI (`Field preset="amount"` / `majorToMinor`); never qepik inputs.
- Pick-lists: `CatalogField` + `CatalogFieldKind` — no `preset="code"` for currency/branch/product/rail/customer refs. Options from `bank-lookups.ts`.

## Modal CRUD (mandatory)

- One index route per entity; create/detail in `OpsModalShell`.
- Redirect stubs `/new` / `/[id]` for bookmarks only.
- Dates: kit `DatePicker` (not bare `type="date"` alone).

## EOD lock

- Mutations respect `useEodLock().mutationsDisabled`.

## i18n

- Locales az + ru + en; no raw English column labels.

## BFF

- No ledger in `era_bank` DB (ADR D9). GL via `/api/gl/*`.

## Deprecated

- Do not add new uses of `OpsDataTable`, `OpsField`, or minor-unit `AmountInput`.
